node_modules/

# The runtime data directory: SQLite database, generated session secret,
# GitHub App credentials when the setup card created them, and every built
# prototype's assets. Never committable.
#
# BOTH names are listed on purpose. The rename changed the default from
# `.prototools-viewer` to `.desde-viewer` and updated this file to match, which
# silently un-ignored the directory for anyone whose `.env.local` still set the
# old `VIEWER_DATA_DIR` — the data dir then sat in the working tree, staged by
# the next `git add`. Measured during the 2026-09-01 stress test, by doing
# exactly that. A `VIEWER_DATA_DIR` pointed anywhere else still needs its own
# ignore; prefer a path outside the repo.
.desde-viewer/
.prototools-viewer/
